title: "sdc-bench: tolerance-aware evaluation of silent data corruption checking in GEMM"
abstract: "Fault-injection campaign, independent verifier, timing benchmark and analysis for evaluating silent-data-corruption checkers in matrix multiplication against an application tolerance, in FP64, FP32, FP16 and BF16."
